<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<jmeterTestPlan version="1.2" properties="5.0" jmeter="5.6.3">
  <hashTree>
    <TestPlan guiclass="TestPlanGui" testclass="TestPlan" testname="23127262_Spike_20260813 - transactional (POST /api/cart -&gt; POST /api/checkout)" enabled="true">
      <stringProp name="TestPlan.comments">Kich ban SPIKE tren nhom transactional. Run by: 23127262 - Ly Quoc Thanh.

HINH DANG SPIKE - ba giai doan, dung hai Thread Group chay chong len nhau:
- Nen thap : 20 thread, ramp 20s, chay suot 300s. Day la muc giao dich "ngay thuong".
- Cu vot   : 400 thread, ramp 5s, keo dai 45s, delay 120s -> bung tu giay 120 den giay 165.
- Hoi phuc : tu giay 165 den giay 300, chi con nen thap. Do tre cua nen thap trong khoang nay
             so voi khoang truoc giay 120 chinh la THOI GIAN HOI PHUC can bao cao.
Tach lam hai Thread Group de nhanh nen thap giu nguyen nhan dang trong suot ca lo trinh - neu
gop chung mot group thi khong con duong co so de do hoi phuc.

Tham so va ly do:
- 20 thread nen: thap hon han muc Load (50) vi day la luong ghi DB, khong phai luong doc.
- 400 thread vot = gap 20 lan nen: flash-sale that co ty le vot 10-30 lan; chon 20 lan de cu soc
  du manh ma van nam trong kha nang sinh tai cua may.
- Ramp 5s cho cu vot: spike phai DOT NGOT. Ramp dai la bien spike thanh load, sai ban chat.
- Think time 1000ms +/- 300ms: nguoi mua can nhac truoc khi bam dat hang, lau hon nguoi duyet
  san pham (800ms o kich ban Load).

XU LY TOKEN:
Ca /api/cart va /api/checkout deu doi header Authorization: Bearer (server.js:290, 297).
setUp Thread Group dang nhap truoc 50 tai khoan, luu token vao properties token_1..token_50.
Cac thread chinh lay token theo chi so luong (ctx.getThreadNum() % 50) - nho vay request giao
dich khong phai gong them mot lan dang nhap moi vong lap, so lieu do duoc dung la cua nhom
transactional chu khong bi tron voi nhom auth.

LUU Y KHI CHAY LAI (de muc 6:93):
- POST /api/checkout khong kiem gio hang, khong kiem ton kho, insert thang vao bang orders
  (server.js:301) -> moi luot chay de lai hang chuc nghin don rac. Phai reset DB giua cac luot.
- Gio hang nam trong RAM: bien userCarts = {} (server.js:14) khong bao gio duoc don. Day la
  bang chung truc tiep cho "memory ceiling" ma de muc 6:94 doi hoi.
Ghi de tham so khi chay: -Jbase=.. -Jspike=.. -Jspikedelay=..</stringProp>
